<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Reinsurance year net profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Reinsurance year net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     105.03 vs  70.71</p>
<p>    Net					 66.59 vs  50.77</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)		13.0  vs   13.5</p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)		18.0  vs   13.5</p>
<p>NOTE: Reinsurance Australia Corp is a reinsurance group.  </p>
<p>    Sales				    518.33 vs 379.44</p>
<p>    Other income			    55.01 vs  76.40</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			     43.99 vs  33.85</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			    nil vs gain 5.45</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 percent franked</p>
<p>Pay date April 14</p>
<p>Reg date March 27</p>
<p>    Tax					 38.44 vs  25.39</p>
<p>    Interest (thousands)		    nil vs  26.0</p>
<p>    Depreciation (thousands)		977 vs  669.0</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
